A signal some [[radar dishes]] pick up before — or instead of — the [[Voidsong]], Embercall is the easier catch, and the safer one; whether that makes it a mercy or a distraction depends entirely on which song you are trying to hear. Tuning the dish away from Embercall is possible, but what waits on the other end of that dial is rarely what the listener bargained for.
